{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c3a7f2b1-84d6-4e9a-b531-2f0e1d9c7a45",
    "name": "TODO App API",
    "description": "Complete test collection for the TODO App backend.\n\n## How to use\n1. Import this file and `todo-app.postman_environment.json` into Postman.\n2. Select the **TODO App - Local** environment from the top-right dropdown.\n3. Run **Register** or **Login** once — the `access_token` and `todo_id` variables are captured automatically by test scripts.\n4. Every other request picks up those variables — no manual copy-pasting needed.\n\n## Folder structure\n- **Auth** — register, login, profile, token refresh, logout\n- **Todos** — full CRUD, all protected by Bearer token\n- **Error Cases** — validation failures, bad IDs, missing auth, wrong credentials",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Override this in your environment file"
    }
  ],
