            "description": "Toggle the `done` status of the todo identified by `{{todo_id}}`.\n\n- If `done` is `false`, it becomes `true`.\n- If `done` is `true`, it becomes `false`.\n\nNo request body needed. Run it twice to see it flip back and forth."
